{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/01 But I bet he can't foil my master plan/Japanese.txt:0": "可惡的索尼克～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/01 But I bet he can't foil my master plan/Japanese.txt:1": "如果你以為我會就這樣退縮，\n那可就大錯特錯了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/01 But I bet he can't foil my master plan/Japanese.txt:2": "我還留有最後的王牌……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:0": "王者翡翠明明\n已經恢復原狀了！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:1": "可是，天使島\n竟然又掉下來了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:2": "到底是怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:3": "難道說……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:4": "混沌翡翠……我覺得放著不管\n不太妙，就帶過來了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:5": "難道跟這個有什麼關係嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:6": "還是拿去\n交給索尼克比較好嗎……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:8": "不好了……\n卡、卡歐斯牠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/02 This doesn't make any sense/Japanese.txt:9": "什麼！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:0": "呼啊～",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:1": "蛋頭博士那傢伙\n這次好像也學乖了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:2": "要不要再去哪裡旅行呢？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:3": "索尼克～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:4": "怎麼了，塔爾斯？\n找到龍捲風２號了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:5": "不是啦不是啦！出大事了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:6": "天使島\n又降下來了啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:7": "你說什麼？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:8": "又發生什麼事了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/03 Who blew it this time/Japanese.txt:9": "總之，我們先\n去看看情況吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:0": "是索尼克啊……抱歉……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:1": "納克魯斯！蛋頭博士也在？\n……發生什麼事了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:10": "走吧，塔爾斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:11": "嗯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:12": "嗯！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:2": "混沌翡翠被搶走了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:3": "卡歐斯……\n那傢伙還活著！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:5": "可惡……我不會就這樣算了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:6": "啊，蛋頭博士！\n站住！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:7": "索尼克……\n卡歐斯是個可怕的怪物！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:8": "要是那傢伙\n拿到了最後一顆混沌翡翠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/04 He's not gonna get away with this!/Japanese.txt:9": "我知道了。什麼都別說了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/05 It's not a dream, after all/Japanese.txt:0": "這裡是……那時候的！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/05 It's not a dream, after all/Japanese.txt:1": "……原來不是夢嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:0": "讓開。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:1": "不要。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:10": "哼……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:11": "我沒空一直陪小孩子\n說這些胡話！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:12": "別管她！上！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:13": "不要──！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:2": "還不快讓開！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:3": "我不要！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:4": "只要有那七顆翡翠，\n我們的力量就能穩如磐石。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:6": "那是我們必須得到的東西！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:7": "人的慾望是無窮無盡的。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:8": "不管走到哪一步，\n都永遠不會覺得滿足……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/06 Please don't do this. I beg you!/Japanese.txt:9": "求求您！請在這裡停手吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/07 Aaaaagh! It's a monster!/Japanese.txt:0": "咿！什、什麼東西！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/07 Aaaaagh! It's a monster!/Japanese.txt:1": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/08 Hey, are you all right/Japanese.txt:0": "喂……喂！\n振作一點！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/08 Hey, are you all right/Japanese.txt:1": "唔……嗚嗚……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/08 Hey, are you all right/Japanese.txt:2": "怎麼會……難道……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/08 Hey, are you all right/Japanese.txt:3": "這不是真的……\n不是真的……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/09 Please, you must stop him!/Japanese.txt:1": "「混沌即力量\n力量因心而成其力量」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/09 Please, you must stop him!/Japanese.txt:2": "「抑制者\n其為統御混沌之人」……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/09 Please, you must stop him!/Japanese.txt:3": "七顆翡翠，\n能將人的意志化為力量……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/09 Please, you must stop him!/Japanese.txt:4": "如果能抑制那股力量的，\n就是這顆翡翠的話……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/09 Please, you must stop him!/Japanese.txt:5": "求求你！快阻止那個人！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克！索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:1": "嗯！啊……咦？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:2": "太好了，你醒過來了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:3": "你突然就發起呆來，\n害我好擔心喔！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:4": "納克魯斯也已經走了喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:5": "吶，我們得快點找到\n最後一顆混沌翡翠才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:6": "對、對啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/10 Sonic! Wake up!/Japanese.txt:7": "只要找到龍捲風２號，\n翡翠應該就在裡面！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/11 Now what do we do/Japanese.txt:0": "找到了，龍捲風２號！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/11 Now what do we do/Japanese.txt:1": "好！把混沌翡翠拿回來！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/11 Now what do we do/Japanese.txt:3": "糟了！\n最後一顆混沌翡翠被搶走了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/11 Now what do we do/Japanese.txt:4": "這、這下該怎麼辦啊！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:0": "如果我看到的那個夢\n是真實發生過的事，那傢伙就是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:10": "蒂卡爾……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:11": "我的心在王者翡翠之中，\n一直與他同在……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:12": "他的心中\n充滿了憤怒與悲傷……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:13": "再這樣下去，他會像從前一樣\n毀滅這個世界的！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:14": "他連翡翠的力量\n都吸收進去了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:15": "必須趕快\n再次將他封印進王者翡翠才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:16": "那可不行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:17": "那樣不就跟以前一樣了嗎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:18": "那傢伙的心\n依然被憤怒與悲傷束縛著。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:19": "永遠都得不到解脫！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:2": "你打算跟那傢伙打嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:20": "那麼，該怎麼做才好……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:3": "這是我為了以防萬一準備的\n蛋頭母艦２號機！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:4": "既然你不聽我的話，\n卡歐斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:5": "你就沒有存在的價值了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:6": "哇～～啊～～～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:7": "可惡……亂來也要有個限度！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:8": "妳……就是妳吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/12 If I wasn't just dreaming, that monster is a real menace!/Japanese.txt:9": "把那傢伙\n封印在王者翡翠裡的人……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:1": "艾咪！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:2": "吶，這個……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:3": "大家！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:4": "卡歐斯是用憤怒與悲傷\n引出了翡翠的力量……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:5": "不過，索尼克一定\n知道真正的使用方法吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:6": "能做到這件事的……\n雖然很不甘心，也只有你了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:7": "能引出混沌翡翠力量的，\n不是只有憤怒和悲傷而已。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:8": "我們為索尼克著想，索尼克\n也為大家著想……這樣的心意也能！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/13 Here, take this!/Japanese.txt:9": "產生強大的力量！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:0": "那傢伙的破壞衝動……\n消失了嗎……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:1": "嗯……超級索尼克的力量\n把它抵消了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:2": "這些是你守護的巧歐喔……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:3": "牠們的生命也在這個世界延續下來，\n就這樣與人類共存著……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:4": "已經夠了……\n已經夠了喔……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:5": "謝謝你……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Last/14 All's well that ends well, right/Japanese.txt:6": "太好了……\n太好了呢，索尼克！"
}